sequenceDiagram
 actor Author
 participant API
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 actor Reviewer
 Author->>API: PATCH draft with revision
 API->>DB: Lock project and update matching revision
 alt Conflict
 DB-->>API: No updated row
 API-->>Author: HTTP 409
 else Applied
 DB-->>API: Updated draft
 Author->>API: Submit with reviewer and revision
 API->>DB: Seal content in IN_REVIEW
 Reviewer->>API: Decide for exact version UUID
 API->>DB: Lock project and store decision and audit
 end
